SUMMARY:West Art Presents: A Wild Kindness - A Tribute To David Berman
DESCRIPTION:During the week of what would've been his 60th birthday\, West 
 Art will be celebrating the legacy of one of America's most distinctive vo
 ices\, David Berman. The evening will feature an all-star lineup of local 
 and regional musicians\, including Jordan and JW of the Nielsen Family Ban
 d\, Elephant 6's Giant Day\, and Cozy Galaxies (with their first performan
 ce since 2012)\, all performing songs from the Silver Jews and Purple Moun
 tains catalogs. Also performing: Super Infinity (Rob Grote of The District
 s)\, Dustin White (American Motors)\, Ben Roth (Sleepy Limbs / The Kaleido
 scope)\, Raf Diaz (We Were Skeletons)\, Nate Yeager (The Scouts)\, Kevin S
 tairiker (Traffic Nightmare)\, Jesse Barki (Sun Not Yellow)\, and Adam Ozi
 mek and Thaddeus Passerieb (Uncle Brothers)\, and more! Poetry readings by
  Katie Rineer and Derek Zanetti. Wear a corduroy suit. We'll see you there
